ce margin, likely, given this is a broiler/egg producer) is inferred context, not a stated fact in the document.", "source_doc_id": "52174", "source_page": 3, "gaps_note": "This PDF's text extraction has a column-order bug in the profit-attribution rows (Equity Holders/NCI split) -- resolved via the EPS/share-count cross-check described in the financial_statements notes for this period, not taken at face value from the raw table order. No QoQ comparison is possible: no quarter closer to this one (e.g. 31 March 2026) has been collected for BFL, only the September and December 2025 quarters and this one.", "takeaway": "A sharp margin-driven turnaround from a loss-making Q1 FY2025/26 to a strongly profitable Q1 FY2026/27, with gross margin nearly doubling on flat-to-moderate revenue growth -- classic of an agri-processor benefiting from an improved spread between input costs (feed) and selling prices, though this filing doesn't confirm the mechanism directly.", "qoq": [], "yoy": [{"metric": "revenue", "label": "Revenue", "prior_period_label": "Q1 FY2025/26 (quarter ended 30 June 2025)", "prior_value": 3454715918.0, "new_period_label": "Q1 FY2026/27 (quarter ended 30 June 2026)", "new_value": 4165377518.0, "pct_change": 0.20570768099838882, "direction": "improved", "prior_period_end_date": "2025-06-30", "new_period_end_date": "2026-06-30"}, {"metric": "gross_profit", "label": "Gross Profit", "prior_period_label": "Q1 FY2025/26 (quarter ended 30 June 2025)", "prior_value": 440337082.0, "new_period_label": "Q1 FY2026/27 (quarter ended 30 June 2026)", "new_value": 858202637.0, "pct_change": 0.9489674435368131, "direction": "improved", "prior_period_end_date": "2025-06-30", "new_period_end_date": "2026-06-30"}, {"metric": "operating_profit", "label": "Operating Profit", "prior_period_label": "Q1 FY2025/26 (quarter ended 30 June 2025)", "prior_value": 74908769.0, "new_period_label": "Q1 FY2026/27 (quarter ended 30 June 2026)", "new_value": 375321201.0, "pct_change": 4.010377